<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Customer Reviews - Wireless Earbuds</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-cream: #FFFDF9;
            --bg-cream-soft: #FDFBF7;
            --card-white: #FFFFFF;
            --border-cream: #F1ECE1;
            --text-dark: #1C1917;
            --text-muted: #78716C;
            --accent-gold: #B45309;
            --shadow-cream: 0 15px 35px rgba(180, 83, 9, 0.05);
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
            background: var(--bg-cream);
            color: var(--text-dark);
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        nav {
            background: rgba(255, 253, 249, 0.9);
            backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
            padding: 1.2rem 3rem;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-cream);
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
        }

        .logo {
            color: var(--text-dark);
            font-weight: 900;
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 2rem;
        }

        nav a {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        nav a:hover, nav a.active {
            color: var(--text-dark);
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 850px;
            margin: 4rem auto;
            padding: 0 1.5rem;
        }

        h1 {
            text-align: center;
            color: var(--text-dark);
            font-size: 2.8rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            animation: fadeIn 0.6s ease-out;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
        }

        .subtitle {
            text-align: center;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
        }

        .rating-summary {
            background: var(--card-white);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-cream);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 2rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-around;
            margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-cream);
        }

        .score {
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            line-height: 1;
        }

        .review-card {
            background: var(--card-white);
            padding: 2rem 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.8rem;
            border-left: 6px solid var(--accent-gold);
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-cream);
            border-right: 1px solid var(--border-cream);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-cream);
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-cream);
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateX(-40px);
            animation: slideIn 0.8s forwards cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
        }

        .review-card:hover {
            transform: translateX(8px) scale(1.01);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(180, 83, 9, 0.1);
        }

        .review-card:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: 0.2s; }
        .review-card:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.4s; }
        .review-card:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.6s; }

        .stars {
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
        }

        .review-text {
            font-size: 1.08rem;
            line-height: 1.7;
            color: #44403C;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .author {
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-top: 1.2rem;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .verified-badge {
            background: var(--bg-cream-soft);
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-cream);
            padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        @keyframes slideIn {
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateX(0);
            }
        }

        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; }
            to { opacity: 1; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <nav>
        <div class="logo">AUDIO TECH</div>
        <div class="nav-links">
            <a href="PRODUCT.html">Home</a>
            <a href="features.html">Features</a>
            <a href="reviews.html" class="active">Reviews</a>
            <a href="contact.html">Contact</a>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <div class="container">
        <h1>What Our Customers Say</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">Verified reviews from audiophiles and everyday users.</p>

        <!-- Rating Score Overview -->
        <div class="rating-summary">
            <div>
                <div class="score">4.9</div>
                <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
                <div style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem;">Average Rating out of 5</div>
            </div>
            <div style="text-align: left;">
                <p style="margin: 0.3rem 0; font-weight: 600;">98% Customer Satisfaction</p>
                <p style="margin: 0.3rem 0; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem;">Based on 1,450+ verified Pakistani customer reviews</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="review-card">
            <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
            <p class="review-text">"The active noise cancellation is insane for this price. Fits snugly during my morning runs and I rarely have to charge the case."</p>
            <div class="author">— Ahmed K. <span class="verified-badge">Verified Buyer</span></div>
        </div>

        <div class="review-card">
            <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
            <p class="review-text">"Studio-quality sound for under 4000 PKR is unbeatable. Battery life actually matches what is advertised."</p>
            <div class="author">— Sara T. <span class="verified-badge">Verified Buyer</span></div>
        </div>

        <div class="review-card">
            <div class="stars">★★★★☆</div>
            <p class="review-text">"Microphone clarity on call meetings is super crisp. Great build quality overall."</p>
            <div class="author">— Bilal M. <span class="verified-badge">Verified Buyer</span></div>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
